---
name: fix-complete
version: 2.3.0
description: Body of the hook's atm send --template report; the hook closes the dev task at dev complete.
format: markdown
required_variables:
  - generated_at
  - task_id
  - sprint
  - outcome
  - resolution_md
  - validation_md
defaults:
  qa_task_id: ""
  sanity_task_id: ""
  dev_task_id: ""
  branch: ""
  commit: ""
  rebased_onto: ""
  pr_number: ""
  pr_url: ""
  stack_view: ""
  notes_md: ""
metadata:
  type: fix-complete
  tags:
    - stage:fix
    - orchestration:beads
  workflow:
    scope:
      kind: sprint
      variable: sprint
    state: fix-complete
    stage: fix
    transition: complete
---
{% set task_id = dev_task_id if dev_task_id else task_id %}
{% if outcome not in ["fixed", "not_reproducible"] %}{{ outcome | outcome_must_be_fixed_or_not_reproducible }}ERROR: outcome must be fixed or not_reproducible, got {{ outcome }}
{% endif %}{% if outcome == "fixed" and not (commit and rebased_onto) %}{{ outcome | fixed_requires_commit_and_rebased_onto }}ERROR: outcome fixed requires commit and rebased_onto
{% endif %}{% if outcome == "fixed" and not (pr_number and pr_url and stack_view) %}{{ outcome | fixed_requires_pr_and_stack_view }}ERROR: outcome fixed requires pr_number, pr_url and stack_view
{% endif %}# Fix Complete

Generated: {{ generated_at }}
Finding bead: {{ task_id }} (sprint {{ sprint }})
Branch: `{{ branch }}`
{% if commit %}Commit: `{{ commit }}`
Rebased onto: `{{ rebased_onto }}`
PR: [#{{ pr_number }}]({{ pr_url }})
{% endif %}Outcome: **{{ outcome }}**

Sanity verifies this outcome on its own task; the dev task is already closed. QA follows sanity PASS.

## Machine Status (JSON)
```json
{
  "task": {{ task_id | tojson }},
  "sprint": {{ sprint | tojson }},
  "branch": {{ branch | tojson }},
  "commit": {{ commit | tojson }},
  "rebased_onto": {{ rebased_onto | tojson }},
  "pr": {{ pr_number | tojson }},
  "pr_url": {{ pr_url | tojson }},
  "outcome": {{ outcome | tojson }}
}
```

## Resolution
{{ resolution_md }}

## Validation
{{ validation_md }}
{% if stack_view %}
## Stack View
{{ stack_view }}
{% endif %}{% if notes_md %}
## Notes
{{ notes_md }}
{% endif %}
